.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ECCE-QM, B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-TZVP, optimisation and frequencies. This calculation shows two argon atoms held together by London dispersion: a Density Profile line from one atom to the other finds almost no density between them, so this attraction cannot be seen in the density.
